{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41869","headline":"思九江旧居三首 三 · 李中","name":"思九江旧居三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无机终日狎沙鸥，得意高吟景且幽。\n槛底江流偏称月，檐前山朵最宜秋。\n遥村处处吹横笛，曲岸家家系小舟。\n别後再游心未遂，设屏惟画白苹洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41869.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41869","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}